            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A propulsion system includes a source of compressed fluid, at least one thruster in fluid communication with the source, at least one turbine in fluid communication with the source and coupled to a propeller, and an apparatus for selectively providing the compressed fluid to one or both of the at least one thruster and the at least one turbine.</p>
